    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>are you kidding me</strong></i> is a slice of life adventure with a collection of narrative driven micro games all about the inhabitants of Nowhere Space - where all lost and forgotten things end up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/5aebd429ab44a81523e12e2bc2cbdab0.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=800 height=560 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/5aebd429ab44a81523e12e2bc2cbdab0.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/5aebd429ab44a81523e12e2bc2cbdab0.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/ef902f4c2eb351203db16d9933b2612f.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=660 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/ef902f4c2eb351203db16d9933b2612f.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/ef902f4c2eb351203db16d9933b2612f.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet GoodLuck [she/her] , MothBot [he/him] Jester [he/they], Rhea [they/she], and a few more eclectic and unusual creatures\u00a0who look after the island, which takes the shape as a little amusement park!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/dc11756f4151c49ec1d81e1723c7a802.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=750 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/dc11756f4151c49ec1d81e1723c7a802.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/dc11756f4151c49ec1d81e1723c7a802.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/ea68023b6a2592c7c8bf6a9e1ef825e2.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=660 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/ea68023b6a2592c7c8bf6a9e1ef825e2.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/ea68023b6a2592c7c8bf6a9e1ef825e2.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have very normal conversations with each to get to know them and their little worlds better. Learn to settle into and become part of this community through a short linear narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/9fbe587655b6b9ec2a4ec7f7c34159a7.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=592 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/9fbe587655b6b9ec2a4ec7f7c34159a7.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/9fbe587655b6b9ec2a4ec7f7c34159a7.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/6ffeccc2131b182dcc7eb77ea9ea2d54.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=660 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/6ffeccc2131b182dcc7eb77ea9ea2d54.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/6ffeccc2131b182dcc7eb77ea9ea2d54.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the world and help out it's quirky inhabitants through unusual mixed media microgames! Carry out different tasks and jobs through playing through these fast-paced funny microgames, each set, thematically cohesive &amp; comfortably fitting into the narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/0a4cb5e8b907f85de75633f577323da8.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=592 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/0a4cb5e8b907f85de75633f577323da8.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/0a4cb5e8b907f85de75633f577323da8.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/512ea9fa803ef03e48543a34e5afeed1.poster.avif?t=1733673154\" width=592 height=594 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/512ea9fa803ef03e48543a34e5afeed1.webm?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/512ea9fa803ef03e48543a34e5afeed1.mp4?t=1733673154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short Playtime (1-2 hours long!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Arcade mode to let you test your skills on just the microgames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 funky and fun characters with unique personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 + unique microgames!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixed media art, using 2D and 3D assets &amp; CCO museum art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >silly stylised art</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/6e294eed820d8dcbb7cbeb8028960f90.avif?t=1733673154\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/961ee67aeb5b6ea0455ba74f882983aa.avif?t=1733673154\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/8853125ebca0de60c87a934fbd476cee.avif?t=1733673154\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0WASD/Arrowkeys OR L stick OR Dpad to move\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/8853125ebca0de60c87a934fbd476cee.avif?t=1733673154\" width=128 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2940440/extras/961ee